@startuml main_startup_qspi
title Main Startup and Guarded Legacy-QSPI Reformat
autonumber

participant Bootloader as BL
participant "Main composition root" as Main
participant "QSPI layout checker" as Layout
database "QSPI partitions" as Q
participant "FAT / NVS services" as FS
participant "UI, ports, plugins, USB" as App

BL -> Main : validated handoff
Main -> Main : prepare console, shell and UI
Main -> Layout : read logical QSPI offset zero
Layout -> Q : read sector via flash-area base mapping
Q --> Layout : boot-sector bytes
alt validated legacy FAT and development reformat enabled
  Layout --> Main : legacy layout detected
  Main -> FS : format Configuration FAT
  FS -> Q : initialize Configuration partition
  Main -> FS : format Shared Data FAT
  FS -> Q : initialize Shared Data partition
  Main -> Q : erase boot-state NVS last
  note over Main, Q : Old contents are discarded; no file migration
else validated legacy FAT; option disabled
  Layout --> Main : legacy layout detected
  Main -> Main : skip incompatible QSPI-backed services
else no validated legacy signature
  Layout --> Main : new / blank / unrecognized layout
  Main -> FS : read boot state and mount normal volumes
end
Main -> App : initialize with available storage
App --> Main : defaults or persisted configuration
Main -> Main : enter normal event/UI loop
@enduml
